Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Security|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Session Timeout
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|web.xml.timeout|2|
	When Navigator open URL
	And AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'Home#ERROR_MESSAGE_EXPIRED_SESSION'
	And AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'UserBar#USER_SIGN_IN'
	And Pause at locator '120000'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'DangerDue to inactivity, your session has expired. Please save any data you may have entered before refreshing the page.' at locator 'Home#ERROR_MESSAGE_EXPIRED_SESSION'
	And Refresh
	And AssertElementPresent the value 'Sign In' at locator 'UserBar#USER_SIGN_IN'
	And User login PG
		|rememberMeChecked|true|
	And Navigator open URL
	And Pause at locator '120000'
	And AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'Home#ERROR_MESSAGE_EXPIRED_SESSION'
	And Refresh
	And Smoke view Welcome Page
		|userFirstName|Test|
		|userLastName|Test|
	And User logout PG
	And User login PG
	And Navigator open URL
	And AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'Home#ERROR_MESSAGE_EXPIRED_SESSION'
	And AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'UserBar#USER_SIGN_IN'
	And Pause at locator '120000'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'DangerDue to inactivity, your session has expired. Please save any data you may have entered before refreshing the page.' at locator 'Home#ERROR_MESSAGE_EXPIRED_SESSION'
	And Refresh
	Then AssertElementPresent the value 'Sign In' at locator 'UserBar#USER_SIGN_IN'